'''Barry the Wizard''' was a mayoral candidate. Their perks focused around {{skill|Enchanting}} and {{skill|Alchemy}}.

== Mayoral Perks ==
{{MayorPerks|Barry}}

The perk "Astral Negotiator" mentioned "Enchanting" in general. It did not affect the {{Item|Experimentation Table}}.

